# Toolchain

Use [contributing instructions](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) for current commands. Node 24.14+ runs the reader; CI exercises Node 24 and 26. Optional source preparation is tested with Python 3.12 and uv.

Use one root npm lockfile and the optional ingestion requirements lock. The root Python TOML contains lint configuration, not a second Python application environment. Use isolated environments for Python dependency-closure checks.

There is no running deployment, container image, Compose stack or Kubernetes prerequisite. Do not restore one to run tests. Local file and MCP contract tests need no model credentials or inference calls.
